    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ATURD ! The Game </h2><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023680/extras/f2cd6779ea36121fb7040e689a7d4c2c.avif?t=1657291519\" /></div><br><br><strong>*STORY*</strong><br>Johnny had to come back and find evidences against his abuser but...<strong> She was already there... </strong><br>Ransack your house to find evidences against... &quot;<strong>The Turd&quot;</strong> and avoid her at any cost! <br>Her dog just <strong>stepped on a Bee</strong> and she is now furious for no reasons.<br>If she gets to you, she will hit you and make you make you loose your mind.. ! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023680/extras/d2e6d19b5c467c7cb57c4391ccf80c91.avif?t=1657291519\" /></div><br>* You play &quot;Jojo&quot; in the Third person view and you need to search evidences in your house by hitting the furniture's. <br>* You will be able to loot evidences, make sure your Ex-wife doesn't touch them or she will destroy them.<br>* Only the furniture's that are not &quot;black &amp; white&quot; can be destroyed with Left/Right Mouse Click to make punches.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023680/extras/5e2f3983eaaaa0ab6d3eee73f9034991.avif?t=1657291519\" /></div><br>* Your Ex-wife, aka &quot;ATurd&quot; is there, wanting to start an argument with you. Her rage increases when you hit furniture's and find evidences.  <br>* The more rage she has, the more argument she will have with you. You need to correctly type the text displayed on screen to block her attack.<br>* If you get hit you'll loose life and die. You will also loose Sanity, causing a confusion effect on your camera. <br>* Hide in the bathroom to get some peace and sanity back !<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023680/extras/05e7b1088ca1db5b7366f30a15c04ac0.avif?t=1657291519\" /></div><br>* Drink wine to heal, because isn't it happy hour anytime ? But not too much... or you'll fall when you try to sprint ! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023680/extras/506b339985dbc2511a3071911a24472e.avif?t=1657291519\" /></div><br><br>* Once you found all the evidences, you will have to find some specific objects in your house. <br>* Lastly escape the map by going to your car ! <br><br><strong>Will you find all the evidences and leave the house before loosing your mind... or worst... that she kills you?</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023680/extras/17ff6805ce27b72d0847d0973d523797.avif?t=1657291519\" /></div><br><br>* Your agent is coming soon to sign your new movie contract ! But your Ex-Wife decided to make a mess <br>* Run after her and clean the army of turd that come out from her body  (how does she do that?!)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023680/extras/307acdebae6d6bc5f7d4349630e899fa.avif?t=1657291519\" /></div><br>* You can make her busy by calling her at some specific location, giving you time to find &amp; clean the turds<br>* You have one mop for the floor and another tool for the walls (Left click / Right Click)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023680/extras/9568399b319737f977c4cf0d157fb278.avif?t=1657291519\" /></div>",
